From f7247b951785ce494205c5c10deccffc199981d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: czechvar <janantl@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:25:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add daily Rehabka: doctor's exercises, streak, clinic visits,
 reminders
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Official rehab at the clinic started 30. 10. 2026. The three exercises the
doctor prescribed (hold on the stair edge, band calf raises on the stair,
toe taps at the door frame) are added to the exercise list and shown in a
new "Rehabka · každý den" section on the overview. They are ticked once a
day under pairs/<code>/rehab/<date>/<exercise>, independent of plan
sessions, with a days-in-a-row counter, a milestone for 7 days, history
entries and backfilling for past days.

The section also shows the next clinic visit (RHB / laser dates from the
Rehabka IC calendar) with a link to the calendar. The notifier sends a
daily reminder when the exercises are not all ticked by the reminder hour
and a heads-up the day before a clinic visit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018kz9BWH4QtBQHWmSQLbGt1
